{"version":1,"key":"card:468","content":{"id":468,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"13736fc2-b353-434c-b5b2-5b286f092a3a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"初始化方法，命名为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__init__"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。不同于普通方法的地方在于，将在对象创建后自动调用它们。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"10317f87-5e5d-4d78-8adf-1dfa76bfbcb3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"71854a4c-46d6-4fec-8350-95d6056b722f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class FooBar:\n    def __init__(self):\n      self.somevar = 42\n\n\n>>> f = FooBar()\n>>> f.somevar\n42","collabId":"4e319d3a-d3f1-45d5-bbce-fb87cdbb2603","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"8f14a132-780c-46e7-b1ff-d88b0a712441","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"df8e428f-4479-4a21-b41b-4bf5998ba489","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Python 提供了魔法方法 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__del__"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，也称作析构函数。这个方法在对象被销毁（作为垃圾被收集）前被调用，但鉴于无法知道准确的调用时间，建议尽可能不要使用"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__del__"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dd87b3a3-02e2-4eeb-a1b0-8c33b8ca8d16","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每个类都有一个或多个超类，并从它们那里继承行为。如果找不到该方法（或属性），将在其超类中查找。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2cf8514a-1e43-40c7-9e1d-36f856eaaea3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重写构造函数时，必须调用超类（继承的类）的构造函数，否则可能无法正确地初始化对象。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6b10a001-5507-4434-b8fd-429e95e74e96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"函数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"super"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，调用这个函数时，将当前类和当前实例作为参数。在它返回的对象上调用方法时，调用的将是超类的方法。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"74fcf830-0288-4be1-8381-39c11f4467cf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2e295010-880e-4b3b-ba22-4b3f8086af4e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Bird:\n    def __init__(self):\n      self.hungry = True\n    def eat(self):\n      if self.hungry:\n          print('Aaaah ...')\n          self.hungry = False\n      else:\n          print('No, thanks!')\n\n\nclass SongBird(Bird):\n    def __init__(self):\n      super().__init__()\n      self.sound = 'Squawk!'\n    def sing(self):\n        print(self.sound)","collabId":"0379be8a-2b3f-4647-ab8b-42af3498aa1e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"34978ce4-f753-4ff2-9414-e7b923b2aaa3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a4823f46-e29b-434b-9509-6f8099dbaa35","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"函数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"super"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回的到底是什么呢？它返回的是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"super"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，这个对象将负责为你执行方法解析。当你访问它的属性时，它将在所有的超类（以及超类的超类，等等）中查找，直到找到指定的属性或引发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"AttributeError"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 异常。"}]}]}],"tags":["Python/魔法方法"],"createTime":1719272633139,"updateTime":1791474923034,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791474923034}}